    "Persistence-gating is the new headline behavior and it held across all 4 evals: the skill picked a different tier per task \u2014 Ephemeral (RefactorBot), Session (FinLit), File-based (docs project), File-based+External (CompSuite) \u2014 and included or omitted the Memory / Reflection-cadence / Audit layers to match. No 'hallucinated continuity' (promising state the runtime can't keep).",
