    "Cost/variance is the strongest quantitative story: with-skill stays tight (100% +/-0 pass, time +/-44s) while baseline variance exploded (time +/-173s, tokens +/-24.8k). Without guidance the model over-builds unpredictably (one baseline run = 463s / 80k tokens). The skill bounds scope and cost, not just correctness.",
    "Non-discriminating in eval-3 (passed in BOTH configs): produces AGENTS.md, observe-only boundary, escalation threshold, daily logs, reflection cadence. The model can build a competent audit agent unaided; the skill's honest, narrow value-add is integration with the user's specific ecosystem (ATP comms, provenance logging).",
